<title>HONG KONG: HK'S Tung declares candidacy for HK chief's post.</title>
<headline>HK'S Tung declares candidacy for HK chief's post.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong shipping magnate Tung Chee-hwa declared on Friday he would stand for the post of Chief Executive to take over from British Governor Chris Patten when the colony reverts to China next year.</p>
</text>
